<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pagamento confirmado — Sonho de Criança</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f0f4f8; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #10b981); padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .success { background: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 18px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; text-align: center; }
    .invoice-box { border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin: 20px 0; }
    .invoice-header { background: #ecfdf5; padding: 12px 18px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; color: #065f46; }
    .invoice-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0fdf4; font-size: 14px; }
    .invoice-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .invoice-row .label { color: #888; }
    .invoice-row .value { font-weight: bold; }
    .amount-row { background: #f0fdf4; }
    .amount-row .value { color: #059669; font-size: 17px; }
    .cta { text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #059669; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 34px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { background: #ecfdf5; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #a7f3d0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>✅ Pagamento confirmado</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Olá, <strong>{{parentName}}</strong>,</p>
      <div class="success">
        O pagamento da factura de <strong>{{childName}}</strong> foi confirmado com sucesso. Obrigado!
      </div>

      <div class="invoice-box">
        <div class="invoice-header">Comprovativo de pagamento</div>
        <div class="invoice-row">
          <span class="label">Número da factura</span>
          <span class="value">{{invoiceNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="invoice-row">
          <span class="label">Aluno</span>
          <span class="value">{{childName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="invoice-row amount-row">
          <span class="label">Valor pago</span>
          <span class="value">{{amount}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta">
        <a href="{{invoicesLink}}" class="btn">Ver facturas</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} {{appName}}. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
